OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FAlex Humphreys introduces an
OL,13,     Fafternoon of great music-making
OL,14,     Fincluding highlights from the
OL,15,     FBaltic Sea Festival and chamber
OL,16,     Fmusic from the East Neuk Festival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Venetian
OL,18,G     School
OL,19,     F2/5. Donald Macleod examines the
OL,20,     Finfluence of St Mark on the music
OL,21,     Fof the Venetian School.
